Z||000000||grinthock||05-28-2001||07:33 PM||||Hey everyone, just got back from Hamilton, Ontario, there is now a car show / cruise night every Monday put on by the Optimist club, 80's and older exluding exotics, and Fiero's are allowed.<P>It's at Hutches, located on Beach rd in Hamilton.  Take the QEW and exit at Woodward make a right, then a right under the highway, then your immediate right onto beach road and left into the lot.  <P>EVERY monday night, why not make this out cruise night we are talking about!  Every monday I plan to be there, and I want lots of people to come!  Who else is in?  More info email me, or reply here<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://grinthock.2y.net/pics/87gt/S_P000386.JPG">  <P>Home page: <A HREF="http://www.fieroworld.com<BR>Home" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroworld.com<BR>Home</A>  of the fiero voting booth!<BR>Owner of 85 GT<BR>87 GT Silver<BR>1995 Ford Escort Wagoon POS||||reg||1
